w Features v2.1:\n- Added Stuck button to play emote while walk or any similar movement (Only works for deleted emotes).\n- Loadstring.\n\n\nNew Features v2.2:\n- Added Next and Previous button that fixed lag issue from v2.1 script.\n- Removed useless buttons for emotes/UGC emotes like Fast button and Stuck button.\n- Fixed an issue when click Add New, the animations/emotes will move/change position like idk.\n- `itemsPerPage` set to max `28`.\n\n\nNew Features v2.3:\n- Newest Label in the edit emote gui & Sort for new added (manually) Animations/Emotes.\n- Detects Duplicate Animation/Emote ID & Show A Warning Notification.\n- Repositioned the animation/emote name, date & price.\n- Separate name & price.\n- Word Wrapped JSON inside `emotes.json`.\n- Center SearchBox.\n\n(I do add alot for this version, but i don't remember what i added & what i removed, only this what i remembered, there's too much add & then delete)\n\n\nNew Features v2.4:\n- Added Spammable toggle inside the `Edit Emote` gui, it work to able to spam play without need to stop it (default: No).\n- Added Stop button next to the Emote's Play button (i can't fix `play` button change name to `stop` button).\n- Fixed `play` button for emote only spammable when the toggle set to Yes.\n- Changed default `itemsPerPage` to `35`.\n\n(idk what i added, only this what's i remembered)\n(i added Spammable toggle is for emotes that stop itself)\n---\n\nCheck the original script by the creator, he fixed the lag issue.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAll credits to @Gaze_ the creator of the \"Fe silly emotes V1\" script.\n(Sorry again, i'm not stealing, just improving.)","tags":["UGC Emotes","UGC","Emotes","FE","Improved"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"664b971b7b31a40c47060765","username":"Irfannnnn","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cbf10bc0c867955a93b4cc77ef7cfa540e1e7c3cda35fee5351587a9a91048ff.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/664b971b7b31a40c47060765-1736073755213.